        "id": 1003000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T04:57:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there are going to be more boards that will need this selected. It will have to be added to all boards that currently select CONFIG_KEYBOARD_PROTOCOL_MKBP but do not have KEYSCAN task. i.e. replace the selection of CONFIG_KEYBOARD_PROTOCOL_MKBP with CONFIG_MKBP_INPUT_DEVICES.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "2fda9f52aae7a62ca61beed2755458b381b9cd4d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a956b1c6_dd799a50",
        "filename": "board/coachz/board.h",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 63,
      "author": {
        "id": 1479762
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-08T23:39:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, the reason for this addition is not CONFIG_KEYBOARD_PROTOCOL_MKBP, but Coachz being the only board that calls `mkbp_update_switches` directly, so it will not compile without MKBP-input-devices addition.",
      "parentUuid": "9a411235_3fce5183",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "2fda9f52aae7a62ca61beed2755458b381b9cd4d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "33635c9b_93da3d41",
        "filename": "board/coachz/board.h",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 63,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003000
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-08T23:51:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But we are splitting out the button/switches/sysrq support into a separate file in this CL. In order to ensure correct behavior for any boards that don\u0027t use the keyboard but use only the button/switches/sysrq support, we should select CONFIG_MKBP_INPUT_DEVICES instead of CONFIG_KEYBOARD_PROTOCOL_MKBP now.",
      "parentUuid": "a956b1c6_dd799a50",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "2fda9f52aae7a62ca61beed2755458b381b9cd4d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
