      "message": "All these configs need to go into baseboard/trogdor/baseboard.h. CONFIG_MKBP_EVENT and CONFIG_MKBP_USE_GPIO are already selected. You need to replace CONFIG_KEYBOARD_PROTOCOL_MKBP with CONFIG_MKBP_INPUT_DEVICES.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 62,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 28
