      "writtenOn": "2021-04-08T23:39:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only direct call to `mkbp_update_switches` is done from board/coachz/board.c - this is why I decided to use board-level config. Do you still think it is worth changing in the baseboard.h?",
